<http://www.spektrix.com/centaurtheatre/event/93802ATNQMLTDBQVKPBTVMHDTGKHTMVSN> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "CYCLOPS";
  schema:description """
	This is a queer, techno-pop, karaoke fever dream, adapting <span class=\"BoldText\">Euripides</span> through Griffin Hewitt’s signature irreverent, interactive, multimedia performance style. <span class=\"ItalicText\">CYCLOPS</span> is a play about using Dionysian pleasures (Sex, Drugs, and Karaoke) to avoid looking at the one-eyed monsters inside of us. (Pun intended).<span><br/></span>/<span><br/></span>Un délire queer de techno-pop et de karaoké qui revisite <span class=\"BoldText\">Euripide</span> à travers un style de performance interactif, multimédia et irrévérencieux qui fait la signature de Griffin Hewitt. <span class=\"ItalicText\">CYCLOPS</span> représente l’art d’utiliser les plaisirs dionysiaques (sexe, drogues et karaoké) pour éviter les monstres borgnes qui se cachent en nous.
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-02-17T20:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
